			"text": "Shadertoy URL TOP — Fetch Example\n\n1. Register a free API key at shadertoy.com/myapps (Apps tab → Add).\n2. Paste the key into the shadertoy_api_key parameter.\n3. Paste any Shadertoy page URL (or bare ID like Ms2SD1) into shadertoy_url.\n4. Press the Fetch button — the shader GLSL downloads, auto-translates, and renders.\n\nThe fetched code appears in shadertoy_code and can be edited or saved as a preset.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
